WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:04.390
So that's the castle of Karasumori. Eh?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.930
The search was worth the effort.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.370
I can feel the waves of power!

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.710
Nothing's coming.
Tokine or the Ayakashi...

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:22.210
Madarao, can you go and
patrol a little?

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.080
No way.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.620
You could at least think about it
before answering...

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.320
I can go after the enemy comes.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.180
The air is bad tonight,
and I don't feel like it.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.500
Geez...

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.490
Can't you listen to
what your master tells you?

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.530
What did you say?

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.340
Don't talk rubbish!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.430
My only master is
Hazama Tokimori!

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.010
I'm only helping the Sumimura family
out of obligation!

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.610
If it wasn't for that.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:52.950
Why would I even think about
babysitting a little runt like you?

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:53.970
A runt?!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.090
How dare you call
your master a runt!

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.160
Oh... I suppose I'll never meet
another man

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.020
like Master Tokimori ever again...

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.320
HAAAA

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:06.760
You little mutt!

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.390
Ignoring me and
sighing at me like that!

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.490
I won't take this sitting down!

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:13.460
Huh? It's here!

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.970
Junior high student Sumimura Yoshimori
and high school student Yukimura Tokine

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:23.210
protect the Karasumori Site, where
their school now stands, from the Ayakashi.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:28.080
It is an ancestral mission that has been
passed down to them.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:33.790
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.660
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:40.860
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.760
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.200
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.600
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:50.770 --> 00:01:54.140
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.480
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:03.150
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.650
Sha la la la la...

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:14.060
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.030
(Secret romance)

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:21.240
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.000
(A strange distance)

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:29.840
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.910
Yeah

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.380
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.990
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:43.320
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:03.510
Tsk, an Ayakashi.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:07.380
They dispersed. It'll be a pain to
look for all of them.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.880
Either way, search and destroy!

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.580
Shut up! I already know that.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.410
Human! So you are the one
they call the Kekkaishi!

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.630
Listen and prepare to be amazed!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.760
My name is Honetaro,
the prince of darkness!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:27.300
That's Ho-ne-ta-ro!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.330
You heard of him?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.540
- Nope.
- Unfortunately for you, this castle

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.540
- So I can destroy him without further ado?
...shall be mine starting tonight!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.140
- Go right ahead.
- Don't take it personally!

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.870
He is an Ayakashi anyway.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.080
Let me give you
some friendly advice.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:43.070
You better turn tail and run... Huh?!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:45.520
You brute!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.580
It's cowardly to attack
before you introduce yourself!

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:49.720
Metsu!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.090
Hey, can you just
get out of here right now?

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.860
I don't feel up for this anyway.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:01.870
Take your friends that
came with you and-

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:07.230
I have never been
so humiliated in my life!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:11.400
I cannot face my friends at this rate!

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.050
I shall get a shot in before I go!

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.750
Take this! Smoke Dumpling Attack!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.250
He ran away!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.550
Yoshimori. Over there.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.700
Why did he run toward the schoolyard?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.060
There's nothing there.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:32.860
Nenshi!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:44.770
Ouch!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.650
Geez, stay still, will you?

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:52.690
It seems that you're getting better
with using the Nenshi.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.810
It's all thanks to my hours
of training.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.720
But I prefer not to use it.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.460
It occupies a hand and it's just so slow.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.460
I heard it was a technique
meant for torture.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.820
Well, it is good for wringing the enemy...

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.840
Torture... Wringing... No!

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:19.440
He's hard to deal with...
This makes me look like a bully.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.210
What's this scent?

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:28.520
Hurry up and call your friends.
And tell them to get out of here.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.120
I can't do that.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:32.860
Why?

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:36.190
Selling out your friend is
the worst thing a person would do!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:39.800
Person? But you're an Ayakashi...

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.440
Uhosuke! Don't come!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.680
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.780
Uhosuke!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:01.860
Now then, what should I do with you?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.150
I-I should be adequate as
your hostage, right?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.030
Please let him go...

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.660
Please...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.410
Fine.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.240
Huh?!

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.030
He's an important
friend of yours, right?

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.870
Then I won't kill him. Relax.

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.310
But in exchange,

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:26.340
call your other friends here
so you can all get out together.

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.320
Idiots!

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.450
Ketsu!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.110
Idiot?

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:36.830
- Idiots! Idiots!
- Even Nagao is captured!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.880
- Idiots! Idiots!
- Our surprise attack failed!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.390
Tokine...

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.330
Who are these three stooges?

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:46.030
I don't really know either.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:49.600
What's wrong, Madarao?

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.470
As expected...

00:06:57.050 --> 00:07:00.850
You are all so very useless.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.420
Idiots!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.150
Boss!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:07.880
Boss?!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:12.620
Can't you even buy me some time?

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:21.400
Can't you even buy me some time?

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:26.630
All right! Now you're all dead meat!

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.680
Boss is a hundred times
stronger than us!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.020
Don't even compare yourselves to me.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.150
I knew it.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.660
I thought I recognized...

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.650
this scent.

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:49.760
I finally found you.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.420
I've been looking for you.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.190
It's been 400 years since
we last met. Has it not. Ginro?

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.300
That old name sure brings back memories.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.840
Huh? You're...

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.940
But I've already given up that name.

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.880
I never imagined you would come here.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.150
Koya!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.350
What is this?

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:15.220
You've started looking so cheap
after 400 years.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:18.420
It's because you wear that
filthy seal on you.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.390
Doesn't it look great?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.150
Do you want one too?

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:27.700
Are you satisfied having
your powers suppressed by that?

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.400
Hey, do you know him, Madarao?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.230
Yeah. We had a little thing way back.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:36.940
And I see that you're still hanging
around with humans.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:39.110
I don't like this one bit.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:40.640
Ketsu!

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:49.520
It only took one hit...
and he's not using his full powers yet.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.150
It was so fast.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.530
Need to use more strength
or I can't block the next attack...

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:59.200
Koya... He's a fateful foe for Madarao...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.830
Do you know him?

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:04.100
Yeah. I think you should
stay out of this, honey.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:05.630
Why?

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.670
This problem is between Koya
and Madarao.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.070
And Yoshi...

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.270
Madarao, I get the feeling there was
more than a "little" thing between you two!

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.480
It's a little thing.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:19.350
Don't lie!
He was aiming directly at me!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:22.020
He didn't aim for you alone.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.960
He hates all humans.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.530
All humans?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:30.890
Yeah... Koya and I grew up
on the same mountain.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.570
It's all in the past.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.900
There it is!

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.800
Let's do it Ginro!

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:39.530
Yeah!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.450
It's great! Isn't deer meat delicious?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.950
Let's eat all of the deer
on this mountain!

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.420
What do you say?

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:01.260
But the mountain was set ablaze.
Humans invaded our territory.

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:07.660
The steel those humans carried
was sharper than our fangs.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.270
Their empty stomachs knew no limit.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:13.870
Even after over hunting the mountain's deer,
it still wasn't enough for them.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.700
Our mountain died...

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:22.740
Koya let's leave this mountain.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.380
Why?! This is our mountain!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.720
We have nothing to feed on anymore.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:28.890
But-!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.090
It's no use.
We can't live here anymore.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:35.460
You?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:41.630
Fine. We'll go to another mountain.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.740
We traveled to many
different mountains.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.430
But in the end.
It was the same everywhere.

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:53.150
Each had their share of humans.
And we were chased away.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:11:01.020
I starved to death.
And it looks like humans killed him.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:05.120
So you didn't forget the past.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.620
Then I'm sure you remember
how you betrayed me.

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:17.230
But I'm willing to forgive and forget.
Let's join together again.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.470
No way. I cut ties with you then.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.230
Madarao. What does he mean
by saying you betrayed him?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.240
After I died.
My soul couldn't pass on.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.070
I returned to our original mountain.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:34.990
And he couldn't pass on either
and also returned.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:40.790
We started to hang out with each other
again on the same mountain.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.330
But... he became much more fierce.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.870
His hatred towards humans
became unmanageable.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:51.770
One day...

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.470
It's the scent of a human.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.310
Calm down. Hakubi.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.640
Ah... It seems that both of them are here.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.650
This is most favorable.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.060
My name is Hazama Tokimori.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.190
What business does a human have here?!

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.860
I've come to exterminate you.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.570
Right at that moment, I fell in love.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:28.300
Wait, what? It feels like the story
completely changed there.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:33.950
No. It hasn't.
That's what caused us to part ways.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.820
That means you're completely at fault.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:40.450
What's wrong with being in love?

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.560
In that single moment,

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.220
I understood why my soul
couldn't pass on.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.330
It was all for my destined encounter
with that man.

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.630
You're a dog! A male one too!

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:51.730
Oh, shut up!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.490
Love knows no boundaries
between species or gender!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.030
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.130
How should I know!

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:59.710
A normal dog like me doesn't
understand crazy talk like that!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.080
But thanks to that.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:06.410
It made Master Tokimori's job of
sealing Koya that much easier.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:08.850
Now's our chance!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:12.410
Do it while they're busy talking!
Go. Uhosuke!

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.720
We got captured again...

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.630
What's with them?

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:24.330
Help! Help! Boss!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.340
Idiots!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.700
Whoa! What a surprise!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:39.070
Awesome. Boss!
What a super way of saving us!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:40.910
Uhosuke?

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.350
Uhosuke...

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:45.640
Idiots!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.810
Uhosuke! Uhosuke!

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.080
How could you do that
to your friends?!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:55.360
Friends? I'm sick of them all.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.160
I'm sick of their constant uselessness.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:01.370
They begged me to utilize them,

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.340
but there isn't one thing
they can do right.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.570
They're completely hopeless.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:08.970
I had no better companion than you.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:12.040
Ginro. We should...

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.740
Give it a rest. I said no.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:19.480
Why? He's not that Tokimori guy.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:24.690
I know. But I've been with them
longer than you.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:28.090
I consider this relationship
a turn of fate, and I'm doing just fine with it.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:32.360
That so? I will sever your ties with them.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.230
Then there should be no problem!

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:44.080
This is perfect. After all, I've sworn
to live only on human flesh!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.580
We can have some fun together again!

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:50.080
Is he going to transform?

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.110
But he's still Madarao's friend.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:56.490
I have to find a way to drag him
outside the perimeter and...

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.710
He's serious.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:58.920
I know.

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:00.460
No, you don't.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.460
He's strong!

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.500
It's because he doesn't hesitate
during crucial moments like you.

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:11.140
You're probably thinking about
taking him down without killing him.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.440
That won't be possible.
You'll die right away.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.950
If you follow that way of thinking,

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.180
you won't be able to keep up
with his speed.

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:21.480
Yoshimori!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.380
Take off this collar.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.240
Huh?

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.310
I'll take care of him.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.680
I'll end it all!

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.750
What are you talking about?

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.000
You mustn't take off Madarao's collar

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.300
no matter the circumstance!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:39.430
Why?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.900
The collar is a seal. There will be disaster
if it were to be removed.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:48.000
His true nature as an Ayakashi
will surface when that occurs...

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.680
Yoshimori! Hurry!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.410
No. But...

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.350
It was me...

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.590
I asked Master Tokimori to let him go

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.420
when he was about to
be exterminated.

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.260
I knew that nothing good
would come of it...

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:06.250
and I still did it.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:10.760
That's why I have to finish this
with my own hands!

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.270
With him...

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.870
Please... I can't remove this on my own!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:21.270
Then you better listen to
what I ask of you too.

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:25.140
Fine. I'll think about it
once this is done.

00:16:27.350 --> 00:16:28.820
Don't tell me that you're- Yoshimori!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:31.950
Nenshi?!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:20.990
I see Ginro's fur is still there.
You look much better now.

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:26.300
You want to fight? You've never
been able to beat me.

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:29.400
You're so dumb.
You didn't know I let you win back then?

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.340
It won't go the same way this time.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.150
You being a sore loser
will never change!

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:49.320
So this... is Madarao's true form?

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.430
What was that for?!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.270
Get out of the way, Yoshimori.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.830
You have no place in this fight.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.540
Ginro! Do you love these humans
that much?!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.950
It's so powerful...
I've never felt an aura like this in my life!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.120
W-What do you want?!

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:24.930
Idiots!

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.320
There we go.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.070
Hey, don't touch Uhosuke!

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:31.400
What are you doing?!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.530
I'm moving him!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.600
Man, he's heavy...

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:35.900
Stop!

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.210
Idiot!

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.070
He's going to get caught in the battle
if you leave him here!

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:42.740
Let him go! I said-

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.650
Shut up!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.050
I told you I wouldn't kill him.
He's still alive.

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:50.180
If you leave him in this site
for a while, he might survive.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:52.190
I-Idiots...

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.530
Spare us your pity.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.320
Come on, help me out, will you?

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.100
You're always so impulsive.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.870
Let me tell you this first:
Don't stay here too long.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.610
Get out of here once his wounds heal.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:21.720
Yoshimori!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:26.320
Do you understand what you did?
How could you release the seal?

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.860
What are you going to do
about those dogs?!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.630
Madarao said that he's going
to finish this once and for all.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.670
We should leave it to him.

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:37.370
Well, I know they're too powerful
for us to do anything about...

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:39.230
But I'm not going to leave him be.

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.800
Tokine, can you watch
over them for me?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:43.300
Hey! Wait!

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.840
There he goes. He really should
just leave them alone.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.810
Hakubi, are you all right with this?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.910
I have no intention of prying
into the matter.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.180
I don't like either of them.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.720
Besides, I don't want you
to have to deal with the clean up, honey.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:00.790
Clean up?

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:10.030
Take this! Silver Rain!

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:13.600
How sad...

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:25.940
This makes me sad.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:29.320
What a pitiful attack.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.950
What have you been doing
for the past 400 years?

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.460
That's what you get for
submitting to humans

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.060
and becoming one of their lowly dogs.

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:41.660
We're mountain dogs!

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.110
Madarao...

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:55.480
Did you forget?
The pain of being hunted by humans?

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.550
The hatred! The malice!

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:04.620
Koya... is that all that's left for you?

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:11.060
There were plenty of fun times back then.
I remember a lot of them.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:17.400
Koya, having your spirit wander
in hatred is a sad thing...

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:22.770
You're right, I distanced myself
from the battlefield for too long.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:26.500
I don't think I can keep up
with your speed.

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:31.150
But I was the one that sent you
away in solitude.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.250
That's why I'll end this!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.480
Once and for all...
even if it kills both of us!

00:21:39.430 --> 00:21:40.160
Madarao...

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:41.920
Is he thinking about
fighting to the death?

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.630
- Koya!
- Koya!

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.300
- Let's... end this...
- Let's... end this...

00:21:56.180 --> 00:22:01.120
You've sunk this low...
all due to humans...

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:06.550
Did you think these illusions
would work against me?!

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:26.430
Madarao!

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:46.730
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.730 --> 00:22:53.430
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:55.000 --> 00:23:02.810
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.810 --> 00:23:09.150
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:18.990
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:25.360
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:34.440
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:41.970
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:50.960
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:59.530
The red string connects one to another
